$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Monomer synthesis (Scheme 1).
Bis(4-(4-nitrophenoxy)phenyl)ethylmethylsilane (2). A mixture of 1.00 g
(3.87 mmol) of (1), 1.06 g (7.74 mmol) of anhydrous K2CO3, 1.09 g (7.74
mmol) of 1-fluoro-4-nitrobenzene and DMF (5.0 mL) was placed into a 50-mL
flask equipped with magnetic stirrer and condenser. The mixture was
heated at 60 °C for 24 h. On cooling, the mixture was poured into 600 mL
of an ethanol-water solution (1:1 vol/vol) and a product was collected by
filtration. This product was washed with water and dried under vacuum at
room temperature for 12 h. Yield: 83 %, yellow solid. M.p.: 158-160 °C.
IR (KBr) (ν) (cm-1): 3,069, 3,035, 3,012 (H-C arom.); 2,956, 2,918, 2,874
(H-C aliph.); 1,602, 1,501 (C═C arom.); 1,508, 1,342 (NO2); 1,252 (Si-C
arom.); 1,248 (C-O-C); 1,108 (Si-C aliph.); 810 (arom. p-subst.). 1H NMR
(acetone-d6) (δ) (ppm): 0.62 (s, 3H, Si-CH3); 1.05 (t,J = 7.60 Hz, 3H,
CH2CH3); 1.15 (m, 2H, CH2); 7.18 (d,J = 9.20 Hz, 4H9); 7.21 (d,J = 8.42
Hz, 4H6); 7.70 (d,J = 8.43 Hz, 4H5); 8.28 (d,J = 9.20 Hz, 4H10). 13C NMR
(acetone-d6) (δ) (ppm):-4.8 (Si-CH3); 6.5 (CH2CH3), 7.7 (CH2CH3), 118.6
(C9); 120.6 (C6), 126.8 (C10); 134.6 (C4), 137.4 (C5), 143.9 (C11); 157.1
(C7), 163.8 (C8). 29Si NMR (acetone-d6) (δ) (ppm): -5.6. Elem. Anal.
Calcd. for C27H24N2O6Si; (500.38): C: 64.80 %; H: 4.80 %; N: 5.60 %.
Found: C: 64.61 %; H: 4.71 %; N: 5.56 %.
