$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM tert-Butyl
3-[4-(3-Methoxyphenoxy)phenyl]sulfonyl-3-(tetrahydropyran-2-yloxycarbamoyl)-8-azaspiro[4.5]decane-8-carboxylate
(29h). To a solution of compound 27 (60 mg, 0.111 mmol) in DMF (3 mL) was
added m-methoxyl phenol (42 mg, 3 equiv) and Cs2CO3 (108 mg, 3 equiv),
then the reaction mixture was stirred at 80 °C overnight. After TLC
(PE/AE 2:1) showed the starting material was consumed, the mixture was
quenched with water and extracted with EtOAc, and the organic layer was
washed with brine, dried over anhydrous Na2SO4, and concentrated to give
the crude compound which was purified by preparative TLC (PE/AE 2:1).
Pure compound 29h (60 mg, 83%) as a white solid. MS m/z 645 [M + H]+
calcd for C33H44N2O9S. This intermediate was used in the next step
without further characterization.
