$DATUM 4,4'-bis[4-(4-amino-3-methylphenoxy)benzenesulfonyl)]biphenyl (13). A
mixture of 4-amino-m-cresol(1.11 g, 9.0 mmol),
4,4'-bis(4-chlorobenzenesulfonyl)biphenyl (1.51 g, 3.0 mmol), potassium
carbonate (0.69 g, 5.0 mmol), DMAc (30 mL) and toluene (30 mL) was heated
to reflux under nitrogen, with Dean-Stark distillation of water. After 1
h the toluene was distilled off and the temperature was raised to 160°C.
After a further 2 h, the reaction mixture was cooled to room temperature,
poured into water (100 mL) and the precipitate filtered off. After
washing with water and then methanol, the solid was dried at 100 °C for 2
h and purified by recrystallization from 2-methoxyethanol to give
colourless, crystalline 12. Yield: 1.68 g, 83%.
4,4'-bis[4-(4-amino-3-methylphenoxy)benzenesulfonyl)]biphenyl (13), yield
83% m.p. 276 °C; 1H NMR (DMSO-d6, 250 MHz) δ 8.01 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 4H),
7.92 (d, J = 8.9 Hz, 4H), 7.89 (d, J = 8.4 Hz, 4H), 6.99 (d, J = 8.9 Hz,
4H), 6.72 – 6.62 (m, 6H), 4.88 (s, 4H), 2.03 (s, 6H); 13C NMR (DMSO-d6,
62.5 MHz) δ 163.8, 144.8, 144.1, 143.3, 141.9, 133.5, 130.4, 129.8,
128.9, 128.2, 123.3, 122.6, 119.2, 116.9, 115.1, 17.8; IR (Nujol): 3474,
3376 (νN-H), 1315, 1249 (νC-O-C), 878, 835, 822; MS (CI): m/z = 676 [M]+;
Anal. calcd. for C38H32N2O6S2: C 67.44, H 4.77, N 4.14%; found : C 67.05,
H 4.84, N 3.91%.
